			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-426199">
									

<p>I don't get the thing with 132, though. Why should that last line send shivers down my spine? He broke rules and was terminated for it. Is there something more to it, or is that all? I've come to take the Foundation's disregard for the individual for granted, so maybe that's why I see nothing out of the ordinary in that statement. I mean, compare a single guy's fate to all the class D personnel fed into the grinder monthly.</p>
<p>Or is there something else that I haven't caught on to at all?</p>

