			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-426924">
									

<p>Yeah, it's nice to put the Foundation in the role of a white knight slaying all the dragons but it's just not. That's what I like, it's scary and freaky.</p>
<p>It seems to me that most, if not all, compassion or mercy comes from the workers (a minority of them). Rarely have I read any 05's or higher ups acting in any way other than in the foundation's interest.</p>

